    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaana ba Daudi abaazaalirwe Hebburoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakabaho obulemu obw'amaani, enju ya Saulo yarwana n'enju ya Daudi; enju ya Saulo yagenda neeyeyongera obuceke, kandi eya Daudi yayeyongera amaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi obwakaba ali Hebburoni, akazaara abaana b'obwojo: omuzigaijo, ou yazaireho Ahinohamu, ayarugire Yezereeri; ibara lye nuwe Amunooni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owakabiri nuwe Kiryeba, ogu akamuzaaraho Abigairi omufakati muko mubule Nabbali, ayarugire Karumeeri; owa kasatu nuwe Abusalomu, ogu akamuzaaraho Maaka muhara wa Taalimai omukama wa Gesura; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owa kana, nuwe Adoniya, ogu akamuzaaraho Hagisi; owa kataano, nuwe Sefatiya, ogu akamuzaaraho Abitaali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owa mukaaga, nuwe Isireyamu owa Egira muka Daudi. Abo nubo abaana Daudi abayazaaliire Hebburoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri naategeka kukora endagaano na Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enju ya Saulo obwekaba n'ekyarwana n'enju ya Daudi, Abbuneeri akeefoora mukuru omunju ya Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo akaba aina omukazi ondi muhara wa Aiha ibara lye Rrizipa; Iseboseesi yakaguza Abbuneeri ati: “Kiki ekikutembeseze ekitabu kya muka ise nyowe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseboseesi ekigambo yagambire eki, kyabiihiza muno Abbuneeri, Abbuneeri mukwo kukaguza Iseboseesi ati: “Nooteekereza, nyowe ndi mbwa ya Yuda? Okuruga ira lyona, mba mwesigwa omunju ya sso Saulo, hali bagenzi be, na hali banywani be, kandi iwe nkakujuna Daudi; hati niiwe orukunjunaana omukazi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinu MUKAMA akakinihiza Daudi, nkooku aliihaho Saulo na baijukuru be obukama, Daudi nuwe afoole MUKAMA wa Isirairi na Yuda, okuruga ha mutaano gumu ogw'ensi okugarukira ha mutaano ogundi. Ruhanga naakanyite, obu ntaacwe goona eki kikahikirra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwiha obukama omunju ya Saulo, n'okufoora Daudi omukama ow'okulema Isirairi na Yuda, okuruga Daani okugarukira Beeri-sebba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseboseesi atagarukemu Abbuneeri ekigambo ekindi, habwokuba yamutiinaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri yatumira Daudi abakwenda, baamusanga Hebburoni baamukaguza bati: “Ensi enu y'oha? Tukole hamu endagaano, nukwo nkukonyere, Isirairi yoona ebe yaawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yagamba ati: “Ego; nyikiriize okukora na iwe endagaano; baitu ninkusaba ekintu kimu kyonka nikyo kinu, tolindora otabandize kuleeta Mikaali muhara wa Saulo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 18:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Daudi yatumira Iseboseesi mutabani wa Saulo abakwenda naagamba ati: “Ngarurra mukazi wange Mikaali ou najugire ebisusu kikumi eby'Abafirisiti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseboseesi yatuma, baaleeta Mikaali, baamwihaho iba Parutyeri mutabani wa Laisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu iba Mikaali yamukuraatira yagenda naamulirirra omu muhanda, okuhika kutaaha Bahulimu. Aho Abbuneeri yamucoomera ati: “Rugaho ogende,” Parutyeri yagenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri akahanuura n'abakuru ba Isirairi naagamba ati: “Omukasumi akaahingwire, mukaba nimwenda Daudi nuwe abe mukama wanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati, kanu nuko akasumi ak'okukora ekintu eki; habwokuba MUKAMA akanihiza Daudi naagamba ati: Omwiru wange Daudi nuwe ndyekonyeza kujuna abantu bange Abaisirairi, mbaiheho Abafirisiti n'abanyanzigwa baabo boona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Abbuneeri nawe yabaza na Bbenyamiini; nubwo yagenda Hebburoni kugambira Daudi, byona Isirairi n'enju ya Bbenyamiini ebibaateekeriize nkooku bisemeriire kukorwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri obuyahikire Hebburoni omwa Daudi, hamu n'abasaija be amakumi abiri, Daudi yabakorra obugenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri yagambira Daudi ati: “Ninyija kugenda nsorooze Abaisirairi boona mbaleetere iwe mukama wange omukama, bakole na iwe endagaano, nukwo oleme abo boona abogonza muno oti.” Nubwo Daudi yaraga Abbuneeri, Abbuneeri yagenda n'obusinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yowabbu naita Abbuneeri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukasumi ako, abaheereza ba Daudi baahika, bali hamu na Yowabbu, nibaruga kuramaga, baaleeta ebintu bingi ebibakaba banyagire. Baitu Abbuneeri, akaba atakyali Hebburoni hamu na Daudi, habwokuba Daudi akaba amuragire, yamurugaho yagenda n'obusinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabbu obuyahikire hamu n'abantu be boona, baamugambira ngu: “Abbuneeri mutabani wa Neeri akaija ow'omukama, omukama yamuraga yagenda n'obusinge.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabbu nubwo yagenzire hali omukama yamukaguza ati: “Eki okakora ki? Abbuneeri akakuhikaho; kiki ekyamukulekeseze akagenda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
