            "sid": "2SA 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabbu obuyarugire omumaiso ga Daudi, yatuma abakwenda yabakurasa Abbuneeri, baamusanga haiziba lya Sira, baamugarra; baitu eki Daudi atakimanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbuneeri obuyagarukire Hebburoni, Yowabbu yamugarra harubaju hagati y'irembo, nk'arukwenda kumubaliza ensita. Aho nuho yamucumitiire enda, Abbuneeri yafa, Yowabbu yahoora enzigu habw'esagama y'owanyina Asaheeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Daudi obuyahuliire ekigambo eki, yagamba ati: “Nyowe n'engoma yange, MUKAMA talitujunaana esagama y'Abbuneeri mutabani wa Neeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esagama ye ejunaanwe Yowabbu n'eka ya ise yoona; omunju ye, hataliburamu omurwazi w'ekiigarro, hataliburamu omugenge, rundi arukwesimbagiriza omwigo, rundi owaliitwa empirima, rundi ow'aliburwa ebyokulya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowabbu na Abisayi nukwo baisire bati Abbuneeri, habwokuba akaita mugenzi wabo Asaheeri, yamunaga omubulemu obwa Gibbyoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
